{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aMirror of the Phantom Maiden\u300b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a solo-developed game created using Unreal Engine.<br>In a mirror world where day and night collapse, the protagonist <i>Rin</i> searches for the truth behind her sister\u2019s disappearance.<br>A side-scrolling horror adventure about repression, fear, and redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Mirror of the Phantom Maiden&quot; is a side-scrolling paranormal adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the story unfolds, players enter the &quot;Phantom Mirror Realm&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through interacting with the environment, they uncover the truth behind a mysterious disappearance,confront haunting memories and strange phenomena, and gradually reveal the secrets buried in the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rin's older sister mysteriously disappeared on campus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her body was never found, and the incident was quickly sealed off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, Rin has transferred to the school her sister once attended,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >determined to uncover what truly happened that day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a campus both familiar and strange,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >she feels as though something important has been left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fragments of memory flicker through her mind,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and the line between dreams and reality begins to blur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She will face layers of mysteries and a suffocating silence,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >as cracks deep within her memory quietly begin to leak the buried truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rumors speak of whispers in the night,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and reflections in the mirror that do not belong to this world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Other Information</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The total playtime is approximately 1 hour.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to livestream the game.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If possible, please include a link to the game's store page in the description of your stream or video. Thank you for your support!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Poem of the Nether Mirror","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3826100/2bc4421d1fe3a0b742f3777e38989f6b7e93229a.jpg"},{"name":"Mirror of the Phantom Maiden","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3826100/9e8561fb1440a9e1a9721c0d8c1042fe9e2d54f5.jpg"},{"name":"Gate of the Nether Mirror","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3826100/71875afee9b70e7ff24972ddeba3fe4aa14d6045.jpg"},{"name":"Missed the train","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3826100/e18f0fc72d0b119348e233f25a11930a7a009dc4.jpg"},{"name":"I don\u2019t want to go to school.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3826100/02e763d457dc8092882a57fbc0499423911d569d.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3826100?t=1755486308","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3826100?t=1755486308","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826100/433fd2e5fefb4f98c0d0a09cf1c68762709fcfeb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755486308","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steams