ugh her mind,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and the line between dreams and reality begins to blur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She will face layers of mysteries and a suffocating silence,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >as cracks deep within her memory quietly begin to leak the buried truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rumors speak of whispers in the night,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and reflections in the mirror that do not belong to this world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Other Information</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The total playtime is approximately 1 hour.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to livestream the game.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If possible, please include a link to the game's store page in the description of your stream or video. Thank you for your support!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Crystal Umbrella Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826100/6b00413d4c0b91675a6240e0ddc38da5983e01dc/header.jpg?t=1755486308","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3826100/71437117/0229e22596fa38f4e998bff483282b389d3bf2f6/1754102609/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754130094","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3826100/71437117/0229e22596fa38f4e998bff483282b389d3bf2f6/1754102609/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754130094","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3826100/71437117/0229e22596fa38f4e998bff483282b389d3bf2f6/1754102609/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754130094","id":257177073,"name":"\u5e7d\u591c\u5c11\u5973\u4e4b\u93e1\u5ba3\u50b3\u7247","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam